            #L5REE17kL7mN9oP1qR3sT5uV: willow_kodama "The willow kodama has not manifested in generations, but a strong entreaty may rouse it from its deep slumber. Should it appear, it may take the form of a hunched being with long white hair, skin of grey gnarled bark, and kind eyes."
        }
    }

